            "title": "Here\u2019s the Good News and the Bad News. 4 Calls From a Top Economist.",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "You won\u2019t catch Tom Porcelli,  Wells Fargo\u2019s  new chief economist, lamenting the lack of economic data on hand these days.  Although the record-breaking government shutdown has delayed critical federally produced measures of employment, inflation, and economic activity, Porcelli says economists and Federal Reserve officials are far from operating completely in the dark.  Porcelli, who most recently served as chief U.S. economist at PGIM Fixed Income, joined Wells Fargo as chief economist on Nov. 3.",
